Remember your questions for review?

Study memory is stored on this device. While it is on, after each answer in a chat, VStudy sends one extra request to the provider and model you are chatting with. It contains a limited excerpt of the conversation (up to the last 24 messages, including the tutor's replies, which may quote your documents) and your course, unit and concept names. That request uses your own quota or credit. When you create review content, excerpts from your course materials are sent too. Turn this off or erase it any time in Settings > Privacy. Chats you exclude are not recorded. Review budgets cover review calls; chat and document processing have separate limits.

